Hoot is an ahead-of-time, whole-program compiler for Guile Scheme
to WebAssembly. In addition to the compiler, Hoot contains a full
WebAssembly toolchain with an assembler, a disassembler, a linker,
an interpreter, etc.  Hoot produces binaries that conform to the
Wasm 3.0 specification which features tail calls and heap-allocated
reference types with garbage collection.
